  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 86211e2fd74fb484598c1176279aee61, type: 3}
  m_Name: Ilya Dialogue
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  dialogueColor: {r: 0, g: 0, b: 0, a: 0}
  startingNode:
    dialogueText: Oh... sorry, I didn't see you come here. My name's Ilya, pleased
      to meet you.
    characterEmotion: 0
    characterReaction: 0
    doesItProveAnything: 0
    isKey: 0
    responses:
    - rid: 767062219271962645
    isRootNode: 1
    editorPosition: {x: 113.8926, y: 190.00002}
    guid:
      Part1: 2008046170
      Part2: 1260890741
      Part3: 3885185170
      Part4: 3718189802
    tag: 
  allNodes:
  - dialogueText: 
    characterEmotion: 0
    characterReaction: 0
    doesItProveAnything: 0
    isKey: 0
    responses: []
    isRootNode: 1
    editorPosition: {x: 300, y: 200}
    guid:
      Part1: 2008046170
      Part2: 1260890741
      Part3: 3885185170
      Part4: 3718189802
    tag: 
  - dialogueText: '(Damn!) *cough* I mean... that''s me, the most... normal guy you''ll
      find around! Heh...

      Hey, so... um... unrelated question, could you please
      help me solve a certain... um... game I''m playing?'
    characterEmotion: 0
    characterReaction: 0
    doesItProveAnything: 0
    isKey: 0
    responses:
    - rid: 3046478613006778484
    - rid: 3046478613006778485
    isRootNode: 0
    editorPosition: {x: 1086.1274, y: 78.645}
    guid:
      Part1: 493333492
      Part2: 1167138288
      Part3: 4201193903
      Part4: 2187594401
    tag: 
  - dialogueText: 'Well, you see, it''s... my... roommate challenged me to find a
      certain "code" that he came up with.

      Let''s just say I need to find
      it fast if I want to get access to... my reward...'
    characterEmotion: 0
    characterReaction: 0
    doesItProveAnything: 0
    isKey: 0
    responses:
    - rid: 3046478613006778487
    isRootNode: 0
    editorPosition: {x: 2202.7424, y: -100.9025}
    guid:
      Part1: 708832069
      Part2: 1217539938
      Part3: 2695101621
      Part4: 2902590646
    tag: 
  - dialogueText: '...getting into my room, I''m afraid.

      The thing is this
      "game" was mostly just a way to punish me for taking so long to arrive.

      He
      got to set the code of the room before I got here, and now he''s asking me
      to figure it out for myself.

      Which is why I''m asking for help, if you
      don''t mind.'
    characterEmotion: 0
    characterReaction: 0
    doesItProveAnything: 0
    isKey: 0
    responses:
    - rid: 3046478613006778489
    - rid: 3046478613006778490
    isRootNode: 0
    editorPosition: {x: 3212.9006, y: -100.999985}
    guid:
      Part1: 239946146
      Part2: 1266075066
      Part3: 581738174
      Part4: 4257914823
    tag: 
  - dialogueText: 'Wow, thank you... *phew* just... make sure to not tell anyone
      else once you figure it out.

      I wouldn''t want people to just... interrupt
      us once I''m inside.'
    characterEmotion: 0
    characterReaction: 0
    doesItProveAnything: 0
    isKey: 0
    responses:
    - rid: 3046478613006778492
    isRootNode: 0
    editorPosition: {x: 4202.71, y: -272.00006}
    guid:
      Part1: 3944833965
      Part2: 1299830704
      Part3: 104953494
      Part4: 72952190
    tag: 
  - dialogueText: '<b>NO!</b> *cough* I mean, I''d love to, but he... um... doesn''t
      like to receive strangers, so I''d rather not, sorry.

      Please, if you
      happen to find out what the code might be, I''d be really thankful. And, um,
      don''t tell it to anyone else, ok?'
    characterEmotion: 0
    characterReaction: 0
    doesItProveAnything: 0
    isKey: 0
    responses:
    - rid: 3046478613006778494
    isRootNode: 0
    editorPosition: {x: 4300.8516, y: -7.999977}
    guid:
      Part1: 3819829899
      Part2: 1308653073
      Part3: 102641286
      Part4: 3373460120
    tag: 
  - dialogueText: Really? Oh, wow, thank you so much! How did you find out about
      it?
    characterEmotion: 0
    characterReaction: 0
    doesItProveAnything: 0
    isKey: 0
    responses:
    - rid: 3046478613006778495
    - rid: 3046478613006778496
    isRootNode: 0
    editorPosition: {x: 2251, y: 587.6262}
    guid:
      Part1: 803924283
      Part2: 1237659444
      Part3: 1312451215
      Part4: 2128099798
    tag: 
  - dialogueText: D-Dimitri did that? Wait... does that mean that.. you already know...?
    characterEmotion: 0
    characterReaction: 0
    doesItProveAnything: 0
    isKey: 0
    responses:
    - rid: 3046478613006778497
    isRootNode: 0
    editorPosition: {x: 3084.9995, y: 483.62622}
    guid:
      Part1: 25498427
      Part2: 1280493627
      Part3: 3783965373
      Part4: 250499973
    tag: 
  - dialogueText: 'So he DID get a <b>third</b> member for the team! I knew it!

      See,
      I told him that a mission like this would require more hands, but he was too
      proud to admit that I was right.

      I respect him a lot, he was like a...
      weird, creepy father to me... but, man, a <b>figure that important</b> could
      not go down without help... '
    characterEmotion: 0
    characterReaction: 0
    doesItProveAnything: 0
    isKey: 0
    responses:
    - rid: 3046478613006778498
    - rid: 3046478613006778499
    isRootNode: 0
    editorPosition: {x: 3936.9995, y: 483.62622}
    guid:
      Part1: 2952297999
      Part2: 1079059291
      Part3: 637297305
      Part4: 4184934732
    tag: 
  - dialogueText: "\"The thing\"? Sorry, I don't think I know what that's supposed
      to mean.\nMan... are you guys already coming up with secret words without me?
      \nDamn it, I thought this would be the one place where I wouldn't feel <b>left
      out</b>..."
    characterEmotion: 0
    characterReaction: 0
    doesItProveAnything: 0
    isKey: 0
    responses:
    - rid: 3046478613006778500
    isRootNode: 0
    editorPosition: {x: 5224.8745, y: 592.5}
    guid:
      Part1: 2954009479
      Part2: 1319509012
      Part3: 1419098807
      Part4: 1616786135
    tag: 
  - dialogueText: 'So far, so good. The <b>target</b> has already gone upstairs,
      and the door sign says it''s unlocked.

      I''ve been really nice to everyone
      and no-one seens to suspect a thing.

      If things keep going as planned,
      I''ll be in there right before dinner, ready to <b>complete the task</b>...'
    characterEmotion: 0
    characterReaction: 0
    doesItProveAnything: 0
    isKey: 0
    responses:
    - rid: 3046478613006778501
    isRootNode: 0
    editorPosition: {x: 5244, y: 293}
    guid:
      Part1: 956334448
      Part2: 1168707074
      Part3: 985916342
      Part4: 2167441247
    tag: 
  - dialogueText: 'What? That... doesn''t make any sense.

      Unless... oh no,
      was he scolding me for not doing my research properly?

      I swear i found
      everything I could about that guy... wait... I mean... science! We''re scientist
      doing research, that''s what I meant... um... yeah.'
    characterEmotion: 0
    characterReaction: 0
    doesItProveAnything: 0
    isKey: 0
    responses:
    - rid: 3046478613006778502
    isRootNode: 0
    editorPosition: {x: 3102.5059, y: 810.482}
    guid:
      Part1: 209685302
      Part2: 1101052138
      Part3: 4035769758
      Part4: 1513944887
    tag: 
